### LLaMA-Factory 数据集注册配置
### 用于合同条款提取任务的数据集

contract_clauses:
  - dataset_class: TextifyDataset
    file: ../dataset/data/contract_train.jsonl
    format: ${.format}
  - dataset_class: TextifyDataset
    file: ../dataset/data/contract_val.jsonl
    format: ${.format}
  - dataset_class: TextifyDataset
    file: ../dataset/data/contract_test.jsonl
    format: ${.format}

### 数据格式化模板
format:
  feature: "instruction"
  input: "input"
  output: "output"
